  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sm_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Slime mould (physarum)\n\n20 000 agents on a 256² trail map. Each one smells the trail ahead and to either side, turns toward the strongest, steps and leaves trail behind; the map blurs and fades every step. Veins form, merge and reroute.\n\nThe map comes out as an image, coloured by the `colors` ramp from empty (first stop) to dense (last). The mouse keeps feeding trail where it is. The sliders set the sensor angle and the turn angle: drag them to reshape the network as it grows.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Slime mould (physarum)\n\n20 000 agents on a 256² trail map. Each one smells the trail ahead and to either side, turns toward the strongest, steps and leaves trail behind; the map blurs and fades every step. Veins form, merge and reroute.\n\nThe map comes out as an image, coloured by the `colors` ramp from empty (first stop) to dense (last). The mouse keeps feeding trail where it is. The sliders set the sensor angle and the turn angle: drag them to reshape the network as it grows.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
